From: hermes-agent <agent@hermes.local>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 02:28:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(website): add screenshots gallery, community reviews,
 and donate section to landing page

- Add 'See it in action' screenshot grid (6 real app screenshots: vehicle test,
  live data, logging, diagnostics, vehicle info, plugins)
- Add 'What the community says' reviews section with star ratings
- Add 'Keep BeeEmUu free' donate section linking to GitHub Sponsors
- Add v2.2.0 release banner and Donate button in hero
- Add guide.css/landing.css/press.css design system and press page rebrand
- Add version_surface test
